# Header / navbar (must patterns)

Apply on every landing. Prevents mobile overflow and dead CTAs.

## Layout

- `fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-40`
- Transparent at top; **active cream/`backdrop-blur` after `scrollY > ~64`**
- When mobile menu open: force solid header bg (match menu panel)
- Inner bar: `min-w-0 overflow-x-clip`; do **not** put `overflow-x-clip` on the whole header if it clips the dropdown

## Mobile vs desktop

| Viewport | Show |
|----------|------|
| `< md` | Logo (compact) + hamburger only |
| `md+` | Optional search / account / cart |
| `lg+` | Full text nav |
| `xl+` | Header Shop CTA if designed |

Hide via **wrapper** (`hidden md:flex`), not only `hidden` fighting `inline-flex` on the button.

## Mobile menu

- Prefer `createPortal(..., document.body)` + `fixed left-0 right-0`
- Top = measured bar height (`ResizeObserver`); `maxHeight: calc(100dvh - headerH)`
- `overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto`; `max-w-full`; no `100vw` (scrollbar gutter overflow)
- Body lock: `overflow: hidden` + `paddingRight` = scrollbar gap
- Escape closes; `aria-expanded` / `aria-controls`
- Shop CTA inside menu panel on small screens

## Nav links

- `font-bold` (or heavier than body)
- Hover: pill / button-like bg (ink + white text)
- Active section: gold horizontal underline (`IntersectionObserver` on `#section` ids)
- `scroll-mt-24` on target sections so sticky header does not hide eyebrows

## Never

- Desktop icons + Shop Now crowding 320/390 (hamburger clipped)
- Absolute menu trapped under header `overflow-x-clip`
- Swiper fade slides covering Hero CTAs (use `pointer-events-none` on swiper + `z-30` on CTA row)
- Primary button stuck gold on touch: gate hover with `@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)`
